component Inbox layout:inline style:notification-center mark-all-read:"Mark all read" footer:"View all notifications" group:"Inbox" note:"A bell-trigger inbox built on Popover. The badge counts unread items; clicking a row marks it read, and Mark all read clears them all. Pass an optional footer for a View all link." {
